@candidates
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
for (var id of PolishGovernment.CANDIDATE_ORDER.concat(['pilsudski'])) {
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_reason'] = PolishGovernment.draftChoiceStatus(Q, 'candidate', id).reason;
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_note'] = PolishGovernment.candidateNote(Q, id);
    Q['pl_cand_' + id + '_show'] = PolishGovernment.candidateShown(Q, id) ? 1 : 0;
}
!}

= 3. Choose the prime minister

A party leader needs his party in the cabinet; the leader of a partner party wins PPS +5 relation with that party. A non-party expert governs with the portfolios given to experts and has no effect on relations. The candidate of the period is only marked: an accepted offer is appointed whoever leads it.

- @cand_daszynski
- @cand_thugutt
- @cand_witos
- @cand_sliwinski
- @cand_nowak
- @cand_sikorski
- @cand_ponikowski
- @cand_grabski
- @cand_skrzynski
- @cand_pilsudski
- @back

