= 2. The role of PPS

- @mode_member
- @mode_external_support
- @mode_opposition
- @back

@mode_member
title: PPS enters the cabinet
subtitle: PPS ministers and full responsibility for the government; PPS chooses its portfolios with influence points (step 4).
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.draftChoiceStatus(Q, 'mode', 'member').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: A cabinet of experts has no party ministers.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'member');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@mode_external_support
title: PPS supports the cabinet from outside
subtitle: No PPS ministries; the programme is the condition of support; half the responsibility.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'external_support');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@mode_opposition
title: PPS stays in opposition
subtitle: [+ pl_cfg_opposition_line +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'opposition');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@portfolio_menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var view = PolishGovernment.formationView(Q);
Q.pl_port_points = view.points;
Q.pl_port_allocation = view.allocation;
for (var key of PolishGovernment.PORTFOLIOS) {
    var status = PolishGovernment.portfolioStatus(Q, key);
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_held'] = status.held ? 1 : 0;
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_line'] = PolishGovernment.portfolioLine(Q, key);
    Q['pl_port_' + key + '_why'] = status.reason;
}
!}

= 4. The PPS portfolios

[+ pl_port_points +]

Each portfolio costs influence points: Labour 10, Interior and the Treasury 20, the others 10. A partner keeps its preferred portfolio when it would refuse without it; the remaining portfolios go to non-party experts. Public works are part of Labour.

Now: [+ pl_port_allocation +].

- @take_labor
- @drop_labor
- @take_interior
- @drop_interior
- @take_finance
- @drop_finance
- @take_economic
- @drop_economic
- @take_justice
- @drop_justice
- @take_agriculture
- @drop_agriculture
- @take_reichswehr
- @drop_reichswehr
- @take_education
- @drop_education
- @take_foreign
- @drop_foreign
- @back

